🍽️ Project 1: Food Recipe Website
📌 Description

A simple static food website that shows different recipes with images and ingredients. It also includes navigation links to explore saved items, search, login page, and different food categories.

✨ Features
Recipe cards with images and ingredients
Navigation links (Saved, Search, Login)
Explore section with food categories
Simple search input UI
Beginner-friendly HTML structure
🛠️ Tech Used
HTML only
🎯 Purpose

To practice HTML layout, tables, images, and linking multiple pages.

🚗 Project 2: Car Service Website + Login Page
📌 Description

A basic car service website that displays different car repair services with images and a login page for users.

✨ Features
Service table (Mechanical, Electrical, Painting, etc.)
Images for each service
Simple login form (username & password)
Clean beginner-friendly layout
🛠️ Tech Used
HTML (basic structure + form)
🎯 Purpose

To learn tables, forms, images, and simple UI structure in HTML.
